{"parentUuid":"a1d2a01b-d599-4ec1-8374-9ab2a2f28a01","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/devin/repos/a2-ai/test-build-processes","sessionId":"7f22a452-0af5-4c0c-be1c-699e971cf878","version":"2.0.22","gitBranch":"main","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JMUsxBrFphVK9Ddr4AoBoT","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/devin/repos/a2-ai/test-build-processes/.github/workflows/release-deb.yml has been updated. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of the edited file:\n   144→            dist/*.tar.gz\n   145→          if-no-files-found: error\n   146→          retention-days: 7\n   147→\n   148→"}]},"uuid":"b693dbfc-616f-48e3-8b31-65b8273437e8","timestamp":"2025-10-18T15:35:29.367Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/devin/repos/a2-ai/test-build-processes/.github/workflows/release-deb.yml","oldString":"  # Stage 3: Create GitHub Release with all artifacts (only on tag push)\n  Create-Release:\n    needs: [Package-Deb]\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    if: ${{ github.ref_type == 'tag' }}\n    permissions:\n      contents: write\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Ensure artifacts dir exists\n        run: mkdir -p artifacts\n\n      - name: Download all deb packages\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          pattern: deb-packages-*\n          path: artifacts\n          merge-multiple: true\n\n      - name: Download all archives\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          pattern: archives-*\n          path: artifacts\n          merge-multiple: true\n\n      - name: List downloaded artifacts\n        run: ls -lah artifacts/\n\n      - name: Generate checksums\n        run: |\n          cd artifacts\n          sha256sum * > checksums.txt\n          cat checksums.txt\n\n      - name: Create GitHub Release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@c062e08bd532815e2082a85e87e3ef29c3e6d191\n        with:\n          name: ${{ github.ref_name }}\n          tag_name: ${{ github.ref_name }}\n          draft: true\n          generate_release_notes: true\n          fail_on_unmatched_files: true\n          body: |\n            Welcome to release ${{ github.ref_name }} of test-build-processes!\n\n            This release includes **Debian packages (.deb)** for easy installation on Debian-based systems.\n\n            **Available packages:**\n            - `test-build-processes_*.deb` - Debian packages with post-install hooks\n            - `test-build-processes_*.tar.gz` - Tarball archives\n\n            **Installation (Debian/Ubuntu):**\n            ```bash\n            # Download the appropriate .deb file for your architecture\n            # For x86_64:\n            sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_amd64.deb\n\n            # For ARM64:\n            sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_arm64.deb\n            ```\n\n            **Build targets:**\n            - `x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu`: Built on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28) for broad compatibility\n            - `aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu`: Built on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28) for ARM64 systems\n\n            All binaries are dynamically linked against glibc 2.28+.\n            The .deb packages install the binary to `/usr/local/bin` and include post-installation hooks.\n          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          prerelease: ${{ contains(github.ref, '-pre') || contains(github.ref, '-test') }}\n          files: artifacts/*","newString":"","originalFile":"name: Release with Deb Packages\n\non:\n  push:\n    tags: [\"deb-v*.*.*\"]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n\njobs:\n  # Stage 1: Build binaries on AlmaLinux for both architectures\n  Build-Binaries:\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.runner }}\n    permissions:\n      contents: read\n    container:\n      image: ${{ matrix.container }}\n    strategy:\n      matrix:\n        include:\n          # x86_64 GNU builds on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28)\n          - runner: ubuntu-latest\n            target: x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\n            container: almalinux:8\n            arch: x86_64\n\n          # aarch64 GNU builds on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28)\n          - runner: ubuntu-24.04-arm\n            target: aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\n            container: almalinux:8\n            arch: aarch64\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Install dependencies (AlmaLinux)\n        if: ${{ contains(matrix.container, 'almalinux') }}\n        run: |\n          dnf install -y gcc gcc-c++ make git curl tar gzip\n\n      - name: Install Rust\n        run: |\n          curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh -s -- -y --default-toolchain stable\n          echo \"$HOME/.cargo/bin\" >> $GITHUB_PATH\n\n      - name: Add Rust target\n        run: |\n          . \"$HOME/.cargo/env\"\n          rustup target add ${{ matrix.target }}\n\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Install Python (for version check)\n        if: ${{ github.ref_type == 'tag' }}\n        run: |\n          dnf install -y python3\n\n      - name: Check version matches tag\n        if: ${{ github.ref_type == 'tag' }}\n        run: |\n          # Strip 'deb-' prefix for version comparison\n          TAG_VERSION=$(echo \"${{ github.ref_name }}\" | sed 's/^deb-//')\n          python3 .github/scripts/tag_check.py \"$TAG_VERSION\"\n\n      - name: Cargo build\n        run: |\n          . \"$HOME/.cargo/env\"\n          cargo build --release --target ${{ matrix.target }}\n\n      - name: Prepare binary for upload\n        run: |\n          mkdir -p artifacts\n          cp target/${{ matrix.target }}/release/test-build-processes artifacts/test-build-processes-${{ matrix.target }}\n\n      - name: Upload binary artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: binary-${{ matrix.target }}\n          path: artifacts/test-build-processes-${{ matrix.target }}\n          if-no-files-found: error\n          retention-days: 1\n\n  # Stage 2: Use GoReleaser Pro to create .deb packages from pre-built binaries\n  Package-Deb:\n    needs: [Build-Binaries]\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    permissions:\n      contents: write\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          fetch-depth: 0\n\n      - name: Strip deb- prefix and create clean tag\n        id: version\n        run: |\n          if [ \"${{ github.ref_type }}\" = \"tag\" ]; then\n            VERSION=$(echo \"${{ github.ref_name }}\" | sed 's/^deb-//')\n            echo \"version=$VERSION\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n            echo \"is_snapshot=false\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n            # Create a temporary clean tag for GoReleaser\n            git tag -f \"$VERSION\" || true\n          else\n            echo \"version=0.0.0-snapshot\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n            echo \"is_snapshot=true\" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          fi\n\n      - name: Download all binary artifacts\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          pattern: binary-*\n          path: ./artifacts\n          merge-multiple: false\n\n      - name: Prepare prebuilt binaries for GoReleaser\n        run: |\n          mkdir -p dist\n          # Copy x86_64 binary\n          cp artifacts/binary-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/test-build-processes-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu dist/test-build-processes_linux_amd64\n          chmod +x dist/test-build-processes_linux_amd64\n          # Copy aarch64 binary\n          cp artifacts/binary-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu/test-build-processes-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu dist/test-build-processes_linux_arm64\n          chmod +x dist/test-build-processes_linux_arm64\n\n      - name: Run GoReleaser Pro\n        uses: goreleaser/goreleaser-action@v6\n        with:\n          distribution: goreleaser-pro\n          version: \"~> v2\"\n          args: release --clean ${{ steps.version.outputs.is_snapshot == 'true' && '--snapshot' || '' }}\n        env:\n          GORELEASER_KEY: ${{ secrets.GORELEASER_KEY }}\n          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n\n      - name: Upload artifacts\n        if: steps.version.outputs.is_snapshot == 'true'\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: deb-packages-and-archives\n          path: |\n            dist/*.deb\n            dist/*.tar.gz\n          if-no-files-found: error\n          retention-days: 7\n\n  # Stage 3: Create GitHub Release with all artifacts (only on tag push)\n  Create-Release:\n    needs: [Package-Deb]\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    if: ${{ github.ref_type == 'tag' }}\n    permissions:\n      contents: write\n\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout repository\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Ensure artifacts dir exists\n        run: mkdir -p artifacts\n\n      - name: Download all deb packages\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          pattern: deb-packages-*\n          path: artifacts\n          merge-multiple: true\n\n      - name: Download all archives\n        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          pattern: archives-*\n          path: artifacts\n          merge-multiple: true\n\n      - name: List downloaded artifacts\n        run: ls -lah artifacts/\n\n      - name: Generate checksums\n        run: |\n          cd artifacts\n          sha256sum * > checksums.txt\n          cat checksums.txt\n\n      - name: Create GitHub Release\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@c062e08bd532815e2082a85e87e3ef29c3e6d191\n        with:\n          name: ${{ github.ref_name }}\n          tag_name: ${{ github.ref_name }}\n          draft: true\n          generate_release_notes: true\n          fail_on_unmatched_files: true\n          body: |\n            Welcome to release ${{ github.ref_name }} of test-build-processes!\n\n            This release includes **Debian packages (.deb)** for easy installation on Debian-based systems.\n\n            **Available packages:**\n            - `test-build-processes_*.deb` - Debian packages with post-install hooks\n            - `test-build-processes_*.tar.gz` - Tarball archives\n\n            **Installation (Debian/Ubuntu):**\n            ```bash\n            # Download the appropriate .deb file for your architecture\n            # For x86_64:\n            sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_amd64.deb\n\n            # For ARM64:\n            sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_arm64.deb\n            ```\n\n            **Build targets:**\n            - `x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu`: Built on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28) for broad compatibility\n            - `aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu`: Built on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28) for ARM64 systems\n\n            All binaries are dynamically linked against glibc 2.28+.\n            The .deb packages install the binary to `/usr/local/bin` and include post-installation hooks.\n          token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\n          prerelease: ${{ contains(github.ref, '-pre') || contains(github.ref, '-test') }}\n          files: artifacts/*\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":145,"oldLines":77,"newStart":145,"newLines":3,"lines":["           if-no-files-found: error","           retention-days: 7"," ","-  # Stage 3: Create GitHub Release with all artifacts (only on tag push)","-  Create-Release:","-    needs: [Package-Deb]","-    runs-on: ubuntu-latest","-    if: ${{ github.ref_type == 'tag' }}","-    permissions:","-      contents: write","-","-    steps:","-      - name: Checkout repository","-        uses: actions/checkout@v4","-","-      - name: Ensure artifacts dir exists","-        run: mkdir -p artifacts","-","-      - name: Download all deb packages","-        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4","-        with:","-          pattern: deb-packages-*","-          path: artifacts","-          merge-multiple: true","-","-      - name: Download all archives","-        uses: actions/download-artifact@v4","-        with:","-       