os:\n      - linux\n    goarch:\n      - amd64\n      - arm64","newString":"# Use prebuilt binaries feature (GoReleaser Pro)\n# Binaries are built in the Build-Binaries stage on AlmaLinux 8 containers\n# This avoids cross-compilation issues and ensures glibc 2.28 compatibility\nbuilds:\n  - id: test-build-processes\n    binary: test-build-processes\n    # Tell GoReleaser to use pre-built binaries instead of building\n    # The path should match where we place the binaries in the workflow\n    prebuilt:\n      path: dist/{{ .Binary }}_{{ .Os }}_{{ .Arch }}{{ if .Arm }}v{{ .Arm }}{{ end }}{{ if .Mips }}_{{ .Mips }}{{ end }}/{{ .Binary }}{{ .Ext }}\n    goos:\n      - linux\n    goarch:\n      - amd64\n      - arm64","originalFile":"version: 2\n\n# Use prebuilt binaries feature (GoReleaser Pro)\n# Binaries are built in the Build-Binaries stage on AlmaLinux 8 containers\n# This avoids cross-compilation issues and ensures glibc 2.28 compatibility\nbuilds:\n  - id: test-build-processes\n    binary: test-build-processes\n    # Tell GoReleaser to use pre-built binaries instead of building\n    prebuilt:\n      path: \"{{ .Path }}\"\n    goos:\n      - linux\n    goarch:\n      - amd64\n      - arm64\n\narchives:\n  - id: test-build-processes-archive\n    format_overrides:\n      - goos: linux\n        format: tar.gz\n    name_template: >-\n      {{ .ProjectName }}_\n      {{- .Version }}_\n      {{- .Os }}_\n      {{- .Arch }}\n    files:\n      - README.md\n      - LICENSE*\n      - CLAUDE.md\n\nnfpms:\n  - id: test-build-processes-deb\n    package_name: test-build-processes\n    vendor: a2-ai\n    homepage: https://github.com/a2-ai/test-build-processes\n    maintainer: a2-ai Team\n    description: |\n      test-build-processes - A minimal Rust binary application\n      Demonstrates multi-architecture builds and .deb package generation\n    license: MIT\n    formats:\n      - deb\n\n    # Install binary to /usr/local/bin\n    bindir: /usr/local/bin\n\n    # Set file permissions\n    file_name_template: >-\n      {{ .ProjectName }}_\n      {{- .Version }}_\n      {{- .Arch }}\n\n    # Scripts for installation lifecycle\n    scripts:\n      postinstall: scripts/postinstall.sh\n      preremove: scripts/preremove.sh\n\n    # File metadata - include the scripts in the package\n    contents:\n      - src: scripts/postinstall.sh\n        dst: /usr/share/doc/test-build-processes/postinstall.sh\n        type: config\n      - src: scripts/preremove.sh\n        dst: /usr/share/doc/test-build-processes/preremove.sh\n        type: config\n\nchecksum:\n  name_template: 'checksums.txt'\n\nsnapshot:\n  name_template: \"{{ .Tag }}-next\"\n\nchangelog:\n  sort: asc\n  filters:\n    exclude:\n      - '^docs:'\n      - '^test:'\n      - '^ci:'\n      - '^chore:'\n      - Merge pull request\n      - Merge branch\n\n# Release configuration\nrelease:\n  github:\n    owner: a2-ai\n    name: test-build-processes\n  draft: true\n  prerelease: auto\n  name_template: \"{{ .Tag }}\"\n  header: |\n    Welcome to release {{ .Tag }} of test-build-processes!\n\n    This release includes **Debian packages (.deb)** for easy installation on Debian-based systems.\n\n    **Available packages:**\n    - `test-build-processes_*.deb` - Debian packages with post-install hooks\n    - `test-build-processes_*.tar.gz` - Tarball archives\n\n    **Installation (Debian/Ubuntu):**\n    ```bash\n    # Download the appropriate .deb file for your architecture\n    # For x86_64/amd64:\n    sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_amd64.deb\n\n    # For ARM64:\n    sudo dpkg -i test-build-processes_*_arm64.deb\n    ```\n\n    **Build Information:**\n    - Built on AlmaLinux 8 (glibc 2.28) for broad compatibility\n    - Packaged with GoReleaser Pro using prebuilt binaries\n    - Binaries are dynamically linked against glibc 2.28+\n    - .deb packages install to `/usr/local/bin` with post-installation hooks\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":7,"oldLines":8,"newStart":7,"newLines":9,"lines":["   -